                  <li>Faster recovery than traditional bypass</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="/procedures/mini-gastric-bypass" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium">
              Learn more about mini gastric bypass →
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Gastric Band -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Gastric Band</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              An adjustable silicone band placed around the upper stomach. It's the only reversible bariatric procedure.
            </p>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-4">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Who It's Best For:</h4>
